火眼金睛 Fiery Eyes in 长安  茶馆的小鸟 · The teahouse songbird

  茶馆老板说：我最喜欢的小鸟今天早上不见了，笼子是空的。
  The teahouse owner says: my favourite little bird vanished this morning;
  the cage is empty.

  大家都知道：
  · 鸟是今天早上七点到八点之间不见的。
    The bird vanished between seven and eight this morning.
  · 今天早上一直在下雪，路上的雪很厚。
    It snowed all morning, and the snow on the road is deep.
  · 那是一只黄色的小鸟，每天早上都在门口唱歌。
    It's a little yellow bird that sings by the door every morning.
  · 茶馆七点才开门，开门以前门锁着，钥匙只有老板有。
    The teahouse only opens at seven; before that it's locked, and only the
    owner has the key.

  ▸ 1  郑老板 茶馆老板  Boss Zheng, the teahouse owner
    2  何大爷 每天来喝茶的老人  Grandpa He, who comes for tea every morning
    3  小李 扫雪的年轻人  Xiao Li, the young man who sweeps the snow

  你：你昨天晚上在哪儿？
  郑老板：我昨天晚上在家，哪儿也没去。
      I was home last night and went nowhere.

